{
  "job_B9.2.7_20251003_115004": {
    "chunk_text": "\u00fe\u00e6t hit swa swi\u00f0e rinde \u00fe\u00e6t hie h\u00e6fdon w\u00e6ter genog \u00dea \u00e6fter \u00fe\u00e6m ealle Romane wurdon cristnum monnum swa holde \u00fe\u00e6t hie on monegum & Antonius forgef ealle \u00fe\u00e6t gafol \u00fe\u00e6t mon to Rome sellan sceolde, & het forb\u00e6rnan \u00fe\u00e6t gewrit & \u00fe\u00e6s on \u00fe\u00e6m \u00e6fterran geare he gefor. \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m \u00fee Romeburg getimbred w\u00e6s DCCCC wintra & XXX, feng Lucius Antonius to He w\u00e6s swi\u00fee yfel monn ealra \u00feeawa, buton \u00fe\u00e6t he w\u00e6s cene, & oft feaht anwig. & fela \u00feara senatorum he het ofslean \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6r betste w\u00e6ron. \u00c6fter an \u00feunor toslog hiora Capitoliam, \u00fe\u00e6t hus \u00fee hiora godas inne w\u00e6ron & hiora diofolgield; \u00de\u00e6r w\u00e6s a swa micel dem geburnen swa on Alexandria w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6re byrig on hiora bibliotheoco, \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m \u00fee Romeburg w\u00e6s getimbred DCCCC wintra & XLIII, feng Seuerus to Romana He bes\u00e6t Piscenius on anum f\u00e6stenne, o\u00fe he him on hond eode; & he hiene si\u00fe\u00fean het ofslean, \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m he ofslog Albinus \u00feone mon on Gallium, for \u00feon \u00fee he eac wolde on hine winnan. Si\u00fe\u00fean he for on Brettanie, & \u00fe\u00e6r oft gefeaht wi\u00f0 Peohtas & wi\u00f0 Scottas, \u00e6r he \u00fea Brettas & het \u00e6nne weall \u00fewyres ofer eall \u00fe\u00e6t lond asettan from s\u00e6 o\u00fe s\u00e6, & ra\u00fee \u00fe\u00e6s he gefor on \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m \u00fee Romeburg getimbred w\u00e6",
